WEBVTT

00:00.660 --> 00:02.220
Tuna kipimo chetu tena.

00:02.220 --> 00:04.892
na tuna uzani sawa upande wa kushoto na uzani sawa

00:04.892 --> 00:05.850
upande wa kulia.

00:05.850 --> 00:07.580
Na kipimo chetu kina uwiano.

00:07.580 --> 00:10.540
Hivyo tuna uzani sawa upande wa kushoto

00:10.540 --> 00:12.450
kama uliopo upande wa kulia.

00:12.450 --> 00:15.000
Badala ya kuweka alama mizani kama alama ya kuuliza,

00:15.000 --> 00:16.309
Nitatumia x.

00:16.309 --> 00:19.600
Na kama vyote vina x tunajua hivi vyote

00:19.600 --> 00:20.770
vina uzani sawa.

00:20.770 --> 00:23.220
Lakini , upi ni uzani?

00:23.220 --> 00:27.060
Upi ni uzani wa kila

00:27.060 --> 00:28.660
kisanduku, tunaweza sema?

00:28.660 --> 00:30.970
Tufikiri kidogo.

00:30.970 --> 00:37.140
Tufikiri ipi thamani ya x?

00:37.140 --> 00:40.870
Kuna uzani wa kilogramu ngapi katika vitu hivi?

00:40.870 --> 00:44.760
Tutafanya nini upande mmoja au pande zote za kipimo?

00:44.760 --> 00:46.760
Nakupa dakika chache kufikiri.

00:49.540 --> 00:51.040
Unaweza kushawishika kusema

00:51.040 --> 00:53.810
kama nitaishia uzani mmoja upande wa kushoto

00:53.810 --> 00:57.900
na kama nikiacha uwiano kwenye kipimo changu, hicho kitu

00:57.900 --> 01:00.400
kitakuwa sawa na chochote kilichopo upande wa kulia.

01:00.400 --> 01:02.750
Na hiyo itakuwa sawa.

01:02.750 --> 01:05.640
Lakini kupata moja ya huu uzani

01:05.640 --> 01:07.890
upande wa kushoto, kwa nini

01:07.890 --> 01:09.390
nisitoe viwili kati ya hivi?

01:09.390 --> 01:13.594
Unaweza sema, kwanini nisitoe--

01:13.594 --> 01:15.260
Ngoja nitumie rangi nzuri kutoa--

01:15.260 --> 01:17.780
kwa nini nisitoe hii moja na hii moja?

01:17.780 --> 01:20.030
Na baadae nitabakiwa na hii hapa.

01:20.030 --> 01:22.470
Lakini nikitoa hizi mbili,

01:22.470 --> 01:24.740
upande wa kushoto utabakia mwepesi

01:24.740 --> 01:27.580
au utakuwa na uzani mdogo zaidi ya upande wa kulia.

01:27.580 --> 01:30.350
Hivyo utapanda juu na upande wa kulia

01:30.350 --> 01:32.232
utashuka chini.

01:32.232 --> 01:33.940
Unaweza sema, sawa, nimeelewa.

01:33.940 --> 01:36.232
Nitakachofanya upande wa kushoto,

01:36.232 --> 01:37.690
Nitakifanya upande wa kulia

01:37.690 --> 01:39.390
ili kuweka uwiano sawa.

01:39.390 --> 01:41.220
Unaweza kusema, kwanini

01:41.220 --> 01:43.440
nisitoe hizi mbili za huu uzani

01:43.440 --> 01:44.801
upande wa kulia?

01:44.801 --> 01:46.300
Lakini ilo ni tatizo pia kwa sababu

01:46.300 --> 01:47.810
ujui uzani ulivyo.

01:47.810 --> 01:49.420
Unaweza kujaribu kutoa mbili kutoka hapa,

01:49.420 --> 01:51.669
lakini kiasi gani cha haya matofali yanawakilisha uzani?

01:51.669 --> 01:53.540
Nadhani hatujui.

01:53.540 --> 01:55.990
Lakini unaweza sema, ngoja tuone,

01:55.990 --> 01:57.920
Nina hivi vitu vitatu hapa.

01:57.920 --> 02:01.850
Kimsingi kama nikizidisha kilichopo kwa 1/3

02:01.850 --> 02:04.010
au kama nikiacha 1/3 ya vitu hapa,

02:04.010 --> 02:06.090
na kama nikiacha 1/3 ya vitu hapa,

02:06.090 --> 02:07.820
kipimo kitakuwa na uwiano.

02:07.820 --> 02:12.390
Kama hii ina uzani sawa na hii

02:12.390 --> 02:14.470
kisha 1/3 ya huu uzani unaenda

02:14.470 --> 02:18.710
kuwa sawa kama 1/3 ya huu uzani wote.

02:18.710 --> 02:21.480
Ngoja tubakize 1/3 hapa.

02:21.480 --> 02:24.792
Hivyo huu usawa kuzidisha kwa 1/3.

02:24.792 --> 02:26.500
Kama tutabakiza 1/3 hapa,

02:26.500 --> 02:29.130
tunaenda kubakiwa na uzani mmoja tu.

02:29.130 --> 02:31.150
Na kama tukibakiza 1/3 hapa, ngoja tuone,

02:31.150 --> 02:34.140
tuna mizani moja, mbili, tatu, nne, tano, sita, saba, nane,

02:34.140 --> 02:36.110
tisa.

02:36.110 --> 02:39.330
Kama tunazidisha hii kwa 1/3, au kama tunabakiza 1/3 ya hii

02:39.330 --> 02:42.880
hapa, 1/3 mara 9 ni 3.

02:42.880 --> 02:44.750
Hivyo tunaenda kutoa hizi.

02:44.750 --> 02:46.580
Hivyo tuna 1/3 ya kile cha awali

02:46.580 --> 02:48.927
tulichonacho upande wa kulia na 1/3 ya kile cha awali

02:48.927 --> 02:50.010
tulichonacho upande wa kushoto.

02:50.010 --> 02:52.170
Tutakuwa na uwiano kwa sababu

02:52.170 --> 02:55.470
tumechukua 1/3 ya jumla ya uzito.

02:55.470 --> 02:57.610
Na ulichobakiwa nacho ni moja

02:57.610 --> 03:00.900
ya hizi mizani, hivi vitu x hapa,

03:00.900 --> 03:02.370
popote x ilipo.

03:02.370 --> 03:05.182
Na unakilogramu tatu upande wa kulia.

03:05.182 --> 03:06.640
Na unaweza kuweka hitimisho,

03:06.640 --> 03:08.223
na muda wote umeweka hivi vitu

03:08.223 --> 03:12.456
sawa, hii x ni sawa na 3.
